  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【2026】戸倉上山田温泉の源泉かけ流し・貸切風呂おすすめ宿！梅むら旅館・ホテル亀屋・笹屋ホテル</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 via-amber-50/40 to-stone-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-emerald-950 flex items-center gap-2\">♨️ 開湯130年！戸倉上山田温泉が「美肌の湯」と称される理由</h3>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">千曲川のほとりに湧く戸倉上山田温泉は、硫黄の香りが心地よく漂う単純硫黄泉。古い角質を落とし肌をしっとりスベスベにする「ダブル美肌効果」があり、エメラルドグリーンに変化する湯色が特徴です。</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">🏆 戸倉上山田で後悔しない厳選4大温泉宿</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第1位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">戸倉上山田温泉　梅むら旅館　うぐいす亭〈長野県〉</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.06</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/18232/18232.jpg\" alt=\"戸倉上山田温泉　梅むら旅館　うぐいす亭〈長野県〉 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 自家源泉100%掛け流しのうぐいす色の湯！千曲川を望む露天風呂と信州牛会席</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">敷地内から湧き出る独自源泉を持つ名宿。時間帯や気温によって緑や白濁に変化する生きた源泉を24時間満喫できます。夕食は信州サーモンや信州プレミアム牛のすき焼き・ステーキ会席が絶品。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>温泉通、ご夫婦、カップル、泉質にとことんこだわりたい人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>混じり気なしの自家源泉うぐいす色の名湯と極上信州グルメなら迷わずここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F18232%2F18232.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】戸倉上山田温泉　梅むら旅館　うぐいす亭〈長野県〉 の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第2位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">ホテル亀屋　＜長野県＞</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 3.83</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/135575/135575.jpg\" alt=\"ホテル亀屋　＜長野県＞ 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 24時間100%源泉掛け流し！エメラルドグリーンの硫黄泉とスマートステイ</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">源泉の湧出量豊富なホテル。美肌硫黄泉の大浴場や貸切風呂を完備し、リーズナブルな素泊まりから信州食材プランまで柔軟に選べるコスパの高さが人気です。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>一人旅、カップル、コスパ重視で良質な温泉に入りたい人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>お得な料金で極上のエメラルドグリーン源泉を堪能するならここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F135575%2F135575.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】ホテル亀屋　＜長野県＞ の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第3位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">戸倉上山田温泉　笹屋ホテル</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.78</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/72823/72823.jpg\" alt=\"戸倉上山田温泉　笹屋ホテル 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 明治36年創業！3000坪の敷地に志賀直哉ゆかりの数寄屋建築と名湯</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">文豪・志賀直哉をはじめ多くの文化人に愛された老舗名門ホテル。庭園の中に佇む登録有形文化財の離れ「豊年虫」や、自家源泉100%の大浴場・露天風呂が圧巻。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>歴史好き、記念日、本物志向のシニア・ご夫婦</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>戸倉上山田を代表する歴史と文化の薫る名門宿ならここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F72823%2F72823.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】戸倉上山田温泉　笹屋ホテル の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第4位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">戸倉上山田温泉　湯元　上山田ホテル</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.1</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/7240/7240.jpg\" alt=\"戸倉上山田温泉　湯元　上山田ホテル 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 大正ロマン薫る老舗ホテル！天然温泉大浴場と郷土会席・地酒の饗宴</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">千曲川沿いに位置し、広々とした大浴場や露天風呂、信州の山菜・川魚・信州牛を味わえる伝統会席が自慢です。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-